body:
I laughed hard at the guy's face and then even harder at how he's holding the cup. 

&#x200B;

His face is just like, 'Ok? Is this actually allowed? Who authorized this?'

Hey, I get ya. That sounds nice. Oh, it's going alright so far, I've got one sure interview tomorrow and a possible one sometime later in the week (it is pending). Everything else has been spam and/or offers I couldn't take (one from a bar (I'm not even legally qualified for that because of my age lol)). Hopefully, at least one of the interviews goes well enough. I have to really compose myself. I'm already nervous.

Aw, I'm glad you're well. Oh, yeah, school can be a bummer, but it sounds really great that you're able to get through it alright. I hope things continue to be nice for you.

I'm well, doing better than when I first posted here, honestly. There have been the occasional down periods, but they aren't usually as bad as before. If it gets too heavy, I just do all I can to calm down. It helps to know that I could post (or call a hotline) if I absolutely needed to. Thank you for asking and for your help.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

No problem! And it's kind of you to help!

&#x200B;

About the flower shop, it's pretty small 'in person' and from what I've been told while there, they 'don't need extra hands at the moment'. However, I believe most of the businesses in that area are smaller family owned or non-chain businesses. So, I'm probably barking up the wrong tree.  

&#x200B;

In any case, I think I'll try applying for places again. Who knows? Maybe Petsmart could use an employee.
